  "details": "Video players appear to be flipped vertically on the latest iOS Closed Beta. Observed on the 2024 M2 iPad Air.\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Travel to any compatible VRChat world with a video player\n\n3. Input a link\n\n4. Observe vertically flipped video",
